<!-- اصلاح ارتفاع دیالوگ افزودن/ویرایش کاربر — جلوگیری از بیرون‌زدن پنجره از بالای مانیتور -->
<Window xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
        xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
        xmlns:d="http://schemas.microsoft.com/expression/blend/2008"
        xmlns:mc="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/markup-compatibility/2006"
        mc:Ignorable="d"
        x:Class="ShopManager.Desktop.Views.UserEditWindow"
        Title="کاربر"
        Width="700" Height="650"
        MinWidth="600" MinHeight="500"
        MaxHeight="700"
        WindowStartupLocation="CenterScreen"
        CanResize="True"
        SizeToContent="Manual"
        ExtendClientAreaToDecorationsHint="False"
        FlowDirection="RightToLeft"
        FontFamily="{DynamicResource AppFontFamily}"
        Background="{DynamicResource AppBackground}">

    <Grid RowDefinitions="Auto,*,Auto">

        <!-- هدر — پس‌زمینه تیره ثابت (#0F172A) طبق الگوی Solid Modern -->
        <Border Grid.Row="0" 
                Background="#0F172A" 
                Padding="24,18">
            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="10" HorizontalAlignment="Center">
                <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconAccount}" Width="22" Height="22"
                                 Foreground="White" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                <TextBlock x:Name="HeaderText"
                           Text="افزودن کاربر جدید"
                           FontSize="20" FontWeight="Bold"
                           Foreground="White"
                           VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
            </StackPanel>
        </Border>

        <ScrollViewer Grid.Row="1">
            <StackPanel Margin="20" Spacing="16">

                <Border Background="{DynamicResource AppCardBackground}" 
                        CornerRadius="6"
                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource AppBorder}"
                        BorderThickness="1"
                        Padding="24">
                    <StackPanel Spacing="16">

                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                            <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconAccount}" Width="18" Height="18"
                                             Foreground="{DynamicResource AppAccent}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="اطلاعات پایه"
                                       FontSize="16" FontWeight="Bold"
                                       Foreground="{DynamicResource AppAccent}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,20,*">
                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="8">
                                <TextBlock Text="نام کاربری" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource AppTextPrimary}"/>
                                <TextBox x:Name="UsernameTextBox"
                                         MaxLength="50"
                                         PlaceholderText="مثال: ali"
                                         FontSize="14"
                                         Padding="12,10"/>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Spacing="8">
                                <TextBlock Text="نام کامل" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource AppTextPrimary}"/>
                                <TextBox x:Name="FullNameTextBox"
                                         MaxLength="200"
                                         PlaceholderText="مثال: علی رضایی"
                                         FontSize="14"
                                         Padding="12,10"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Grid>

                        <Grid x:Name="PasswordGrid" ColumnDefinitions="*,20,*">
                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="8">
                                <TextBlock Text="رمز عبور" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource AppTextPrimary}"/>
                                <TextBox x:Name="PasswordTextBox"
                                         PasswordChar="●"
                                         PlaceholderText="حداقل ۴ کاراکتر"
                                         FontSize="14"
                                         Padding="12,10"/>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Spacing="8">
                                <TextBlock Text="تکرار رمز عبور" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource AppTextPrimary}"/>
                                <TextBox x:Name="ConfirmPasswordTextBox"
                                         PasswordChar="●"
                                         FontSize="14"
                                         Padding="12,10"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Grid>

                        <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,20,*">
                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="0" Spacing="8">
                                <TextBlock Text="نقش کاربر" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource AppTextPrimary}"/>
                                <ComboBox x:Name="RoleComboBox"
                                          SelectedIndex="1"
                                          HorizontalAlignment="Stretch"
                                          FontSize="14"
                                          Padding="12,10">
                                    <ComboBoxItem>
                                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                            <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconShieldAccount}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="ادمین"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </ComboBoxItem>
                                    <ComboBoxItem>
                                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                            <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconAccount}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                            <TextBlock Text="کاربر عادی"/>
                                        </StackPanel>
                                    </ComboBoxItem>
                                </ComboBox>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <StackPanel Grid.Column="2" Spacing="8">
                                <TextBlock Text="وضعیت" FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource AppTextPrimary}"/>
                                <CheckBox x:Name="IsActiveCheckBox"
                                          IsChecked="True"
                                          FontSize="14">
                                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                        <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconToggleSwitch}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                        <TextBlock Text="کاربر فعال است"/>
                                    </StackPanel>
                                </CheckBox>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </Grid>

                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>

                <Border Background="{DynamicResource AppCardBackground}" 
                        CornerRadius="6"
                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource AppBorder}"
                        BorderThickness="1"
                        Padding="24">
                    <StackPanel Spacing="16">

                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                            <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconShieldAccount}" Width="18" Height="18"
                                             Foreground="{DynamicResource AppAccent}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="دسترسی‌ها"
                                       FontSize="16" FontWeight="Bold"
                                       Foreground="{DynamicResource AppAccent}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- پیام هشدار — طبق الگوی Solid Modern فقط متن رنگی (بدون پس‌زمینه) -->
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                            <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconAlertOutline}" Width="16" Height="16"
                                             Foreground="{DynamicResource AppWarning}" VerticalAlignment="Top"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="اگه نقش «ادمین» باشه، همه دسترسی‌ها خودکار داده می‌شه"
                                       FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource AppWarning}"
                                       TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <TextBlock Text="بخش‌های اصلی"
                                   FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                   Foreground="{DynamicResource AppTextSecondary}"/>

                        <WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                            <CheckBox x:Name="CanDashboardCheckBox" FontSize="13" Margin="0,0,20,10">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                    <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconViewDashboard}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="داشبورد"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </CheckBox>
                            <CheckBox x:Name="CanItemsCheckBox" FontSize="13" Margin="0,0,20,10">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                    <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconPackage}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="کالاها"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </CheckBox>
                            <CheckBox x:Name="CanPurchaseCheckBox" FontSize="13" Margin="0,0,20,10">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                    <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconCart}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="خرید"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </CheckBox>
                            <CheckBox x:Name="CanTransferCheckBox" FontSize="13" Margin="0,0,20,10">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                    <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconTruck}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="انتقال"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </CheckBox>
                            <CheckBox x:Name="CanPOSCheckBox" FontSize="13" Margin="0,0,20,10">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                    <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconMonitor}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="صندوق فروش (POS)"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </CheckBox>
                            <CheckBox x:Name="CanCustomersCheckBox" FontSize="13" Margin="0,0,20,10">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                    <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconAccountMultiple}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="مشتری‌ها"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </CheckBox>
                            <CheckBox x:Name="CanStatsCheckBox" FontSize="13" Margin="0,0,20,10">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                    <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconChartLine}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="آمار"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </CheckBox>
                            <CheckBox x:Name="CanCashboxCheckBox" FontSize="13" Margin="0,0,20,10">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                    <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconBank}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="صندوق"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </CheckBox>
                            <CheckBox x:Name="CanSettingsCheckBox" FontSize="13" Margin="0,0,20,10">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                    <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconCog}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="تنظیمات"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </CheckBox>
                        </WrapPanel>

                        <TextBlock Text="دسترسی‌های ویژه"
                                   FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                   Foreground="{DynamicResource AppTextSecondary}"
                                   Margin="0,10,0,0"/>

                        <WrapPanel Orientation="Horizontal">
                            <CheckBox x:Name="CanPrintCheckBox" FontSize="13" Margin="0,0,20,10"
                                      IsChecked="True">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                    <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconPrinter}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="چاپ"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </CheckBox>
                            <CheckBox x:Name="CanExportExcelCheckBox" FontSize="13" Margin="0,0,20,10">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                    <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconFileExcel}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="خروجی اکسل"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </CheckBox>
                            <CheckBox x:Name="CanUserManagementCheckBox" FontSize="13" Margin="0,0,20,10">
                                <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                    <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconShieldAccount}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                    <TextBlock Text="مدیریت کاربران"/>
                                </StackPanel>
                            </CheckBox>
                        </WrapPanel>

                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>

                <!-- کارت دسترسی مالی -->
                <Border Background="{DynamicResource AppCardBackground}" 
                        CornerRadius="6"
                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource AppBorder}"
                        BorderThickness="1"
                        Padding="24">
                    <StackPanel Spacing="14">

                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                            <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconLock}" Width="18" Height="18"
                                             Foreground="{DynamicResource AppAccent}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                            <TextBlock Text="دسترسی مالی"
                                       FontSize="16" FontWeight="Bold"
                                       Foreground="{DynamicResource AppAccent}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <!-- پیام هشدار — طبق الگوی Solid Modern فقط متن رنگی (بدون پس‌زمینه) -->
                        <StackPanel Spacing="8">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                                <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconLock}" Width="16" Height="16"
                                                 Foreground="{DynamicResource AppDanger}" VerticalAlignment="Top"/>
                                <TextBlock Text="وقتی این گزینه غیرفعال باشه، اعداد مالی در همه‌جا نمایش داده نمیشن"
                                           FontSize="12" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource AppDanger}"
                                           TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <StackPanel Spacing="4">
                                <TextBlock Text="• موجودی صندوق (نقد فیزیکی)"
                                           FontSize="11" Foreground="{DynamicResource AppDanger}"/>
                                <TextBlock Text="• ارزش انبار و مغازه"
                                           FontSize="11" Foreground="{DynamicResource AppDanger}"/>
                                <TextBlock Text="• سود و درآمد فروش‌ها"
                                           FontSize="11" Foreground="{DynamicResource AppDanger}"/>
                                <TextBlock Text="• گزارش‌های مالی و آماری"
                                           FontSize="11" Foreground="{DynamicResource AppDanger}"/>
                                <TextBlock Text="• مبالغ خرید و مشتری‌ها"
                                           FontSize="11" Foreground="{DynamicResource AppDanger}"/>
                            </StackPanel>

                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6" Margin="0,4,0,0">
                                <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconCheck}" Width="14" Height="14"
                                                 Foreground="{DynamicResource AppSuccess}" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                <TextBlock Text="فقط POS (صندوق فروش روزانه خودش) کار می‌کنه"
                                           FontSize="11" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                           Foreground="{DynamicResource AppSuccess}"
                                           TextWrapping="Wrap"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </StackPanel>

                        <CheckBox x:Name="CanViewFinanceCheckBox" 
                                  FontSize="15" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                                  Foreground="{DynamicResource AppTextPrimary}">
                            <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="6">
                                <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconCurrencyUsd}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                                <TextBlock Text="اجازه مشاهده اعداد و ارقام مالی"/>
                            </StackPanel>
                        </CheckBox>

                    </StackPanel>
                </Border>

            </StackPanel>
        </ScrollViewer>

        <Border Grid.Row="2" 
                Background="{DynamicResource AppCardBackground}" 
                Padding="20,16"
                BorderBrush="{DynamicResource AppBorder}"
                BorderThickness="0,1,0,0">
            <Grid ColumnDefinitions="*,Auto,Auto">
                <TextBlock Grid.Column="0"
                           x:Name="StatusText"
                           Text=""
                           VerticalAlignment="Center"
                           FontSize="13" FontWeight="SemiBold"
                           Foreground="{DynamicResource AppDanger}"
                           TextWrapping="Wrap"/>

                <Button Grid.Column="1"
                        FontSize="15" FontWeight="Bold"
                        Background="{DynamicResource AppSuccess}"
                        Foreground="White"
                        Padding="30,12"
                        Margin="0,0,10,0"
                        CornerRadius="6"
                        Click="OnSaveClick">
                    <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Spacing="8">
                        <PathIcon Data="{StaticResource IconContentSave}" Width="16" Height="16" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                        <TextBlock Text="ذخیره" VerticalAlignment="Center"/>
                    </StackPanel>
                </Button>

                <Button Grid.Column="2"
                        Content="انصراف"
                        FontSize="15"
                        Background="{DynamicResource AppBackground}"
                        Foreground="{DynamicResource AppTextPrimary}"
                        BorderBrush="{DynamicResource AppBorder}"
                        BorderThickness="1"
                        Padding="30,12"
                        CornerRadius="6"
                        Click="OnCancelClick"/>
            </Grid>
        </Border>

    </Grid>

</Window>
